  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This release hardens command composition in `RunnerProcessFactory`, which builds the configuration used to run a program through another program.\n\n#### Changed\n- Updated DotExtensions to 10.6.1 from 10.5.1.\n- Updated internal Polyfill version from 11.4.0 to 11.4.5.\n- Updated Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13.\n\n#### Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where `ShellDetector` would strip version separators in a version string before parsing the shell version string.\n- Fixed an issue where `ArgumentsBuilder` would escape individual arguments before joining them in `AddEnumerable(string)`.",
